@MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5197

# ===================================================================
# READ-ONLY QUERIES (No database mutations)
# ===================================================================

### 1. Get all branches
GET {{MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress}}/branches
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get all products
GET {{MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress}}/products
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get branch stock for Colombo (ID: 1)
GET {{MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress}}/branches/1/stock
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Get branch stock for nonexistent branch (ID: 999) - Returns 404 Not Found
GET {{MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress}}/branches/999/stock
Accept: application/json

###

# ===================================================================
# STOCK TRANSFER MUTATIONS (Changes database state)
# ===================================================================

### 5. Valid Transfer: Move 5 packages of Rice from Colombo (1) to Kandy (2)
# [MUTATION]: Deducts 5 from Colombo, adds 5 to Kandy, writes transfer history
POST {{MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "fromBranchId": 1,
  "toBranchId": 2,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 5
}

###

### 6. Rejected: Insufficient Stock - Returns 409 Conflict (No mutation)
POST {{MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "fromBranchId": 1,
  "toBranchId": 2,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 9999
}

###

### 7. Rejected: Same Source & Destination Branch - Returns 400 Bad Request (No mutation)
POST {{MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "fromBranchId": 1,
  "toBranchId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 5
}

###

### 8. Rejected: Zero Quantity - Returns 400 Bad Request (No mutation)
POST {{MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "fromBranchId": 1,
  "toBranchId": 2,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 0
}

###

### 9. Rejected: Nonexistent Product - Returns 404 Not Found (No mutation)
POST {{MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "fromBranchId": 1,
  "toBranchId": 2,
  "productId": 999,
  "quantity": 5
}

###

# ===================================================================
# TRANSFER HISTORY (Read-only query)
# ===================================================================

### 10. Get Transfer History: Returns successful transfers ordered newest first
GET {{MihiraStockTransfer.Api_HostAddress}}/transfers
Accept: application/json

###
